          "text": "Team WE’s current run is more impressive but it isn’t the first time the orgs been in this position.\n\nSpring 2015 WE was flatly the worst team in the LPL w/ no group separation. Worse than even Energy Pacemakers the perennial last place talent farm.\nAfter Week 7, last place WE participates in IEM World Championships after qualifying the year before. \n\nAdding Mystic & Xiye to their roster they defeat Gambit, CJ Entus & GE Tigers and make an international finals.\n\nWE would return in Week 9 LPL and barely scrape Playoffs and have the most meme’d game 5 series with eventual champions EDG where EDG’s San Shao spoke on how Pawn was rushed from the hospital from his back injury to play in game 5 stating “EDG needs me” to defeat WE."
